  "description": [
    "159 pages : 23 cm",
    "\"Hour Detroit's first-ever cookbook is a welcome addition to the kitchen of any home chef. Beautiful photographs and detailed directions provide \"how-to\" steps to recreate must-try dishes from some of metro Detroit's most celebrated chefs. These tested and perfected appetizers, entrées, desserts, drinks, and more were all served at our Savor Detroit dinner series. Enjoy!\"--Back cover",
    "Volume number from spine",
    "\"Let your taste buds Savor more than 140 recipes from the city's most celebrated chefs.\"",
    "Includes index"
  ],
